Subject: [niri v26.04] Register the shared Anland backend

Integration extracted from Celvra/ANiri 1a33594f42efef6415096de504214269d82c247d
and reviewed through cfd31db9c79c681a11ebc1afdb80fa7b31c4f7e0. The fork starts
with an imported tree, not upstream history. Rebase only the backend dispatch,
ANLAND startup selection and clipboard callback onto official niri v26.04
(8ed0da44d974c32c6877d2f4630c314da0717ecb).

No src/backend/anland implementation, private transport, documentation, test
snapshots, unrelated post-release features or dependency upgrades are included.
The runtime adapter comes exclusively from the repository overlay. build.rs
links the shared producer bridge. Smithay stays at the release-pinned revision;
only its source location changes to the adjacent, separately patched archive.
Cargo.lock changes only those two source identities, not dependency versions.

